{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":164292,\"title\":\"Hollywood Barn Dance\",\"tagline\":\"IT'S RURAL, RHYTHMIC, ROMANTIC!\",\"overview\":\"Based on and built around the west coast radio program, \\\"The Hollywood Barn Dance\\\", although no members of the 1947 cast of the program are in the film, but the better-known (on a national scale) Ernest Tubb and His Texas Troubadors, Jack Guthrie and Jimmy and Leon Short more than make up for that. The slight plot, around 18 songs, begins with Tubb and his band searching for $2000 needed to rebuild their town chuch after it burned down while they were rehearsing in it. Hollywood, here they come!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/17PgNsQw5oexwB8dKxXTmSOmrU1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/amv02lVcdFiqUcISlgwHVVgqYJc.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"year\":1947,\"runtime\":72,\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Western\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Bernard B. Ray\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":117573,\"name\":\"Bernard B. Ray\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lxO7qV3WCPKKwmJVOwtHsialz3r.jpg\"},{\"id\":1244625,\"name\":\"Ernest Tubb\",\"character\":\"Ernest Tubb\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkUF3YxX4yMYW9Ia4RixVlQbLnC.jpg\"},{\"id\":88641,\"name\":\"Helen Boyce\",\"character\":\"Esmeralda Perkins\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":986971,\"name\":\"Lori Talbott\",\"character\":\"Helen Cartwright\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1145704,\"name\":\"Ann Kunde\",\"character\":\"Ma Tubb\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":89938,\"name\":\"Earle Hodgins\",\"character\":\"Francis D. Cartwright\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tdoaxQUuE9Ko5PtQsrqDXdFIJpU.jpg\"},{\"id\":134868,\"name\":\"Frank McGlynn Sr.\",\"character\":\"Hiram Tubb\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rVmcxe3urwZmHhtRjAtRS5AQhyK.jpg\"},{\"id\":1550919